# REST

## 1. Admin Section
### 1.1 Login (Admin)
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": true
}

### 1.2 Signup
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### 1.4 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "",
    "password": "",
    "passwordConfirmation": ""
}

### 1.5 Profile
GET http://localhost:9093/admin/me

Authorization: Bearer <Token>

## 2. User Section
### 2.1 Login (User)
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.2 Signup
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### 2.4 Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "",
    "password": "",
    "passwordConfirmation": ""
}

### 2.5 Profile
GET http://localhost:9093/api/auth/me

Authorization: Bearer <Token>